      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "German immigrants settled the area during the construction of the Miami and Erie Canal in the 1830s, and the town flourished until railroads made the canal obsolete.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
