      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The original fort served as a supply depot during the War of 1812 and a waystation for expeditions against the British in Michigan and Canada.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fort_Loramie%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Archaeological excavations in 2013 and 2021 rediscovered the original trading post and fort sites, cementing the village’s rich historic legacy.",
